                "text": "Today, to mark National Infertility Awareness Week, I\u2019m proud to bring together patients, doctors, and advocates for an important conversation on infertility and IVF. \n\nThe right to start and build a family on your own terms is sacrosanct. We won\u2019t back down from this fight. https://t.co/Va7CuPnYwA",
